# What the Python checks need beyond the pipeline itself: the test runner,
# the type checker and linter they are gated on, and what the server's tests
# import. The CI job (.github/workflows/python.yml) installs the hashed lock
# compiled from this, requirements-dev.txt. Regenerate after editing:
#   uv pip compile requirements-dev.in --generate-hashes \
#     --python-version 3.12 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 \
#     -o requirements-dev.txt
-r pipeline/requirements.in
